      "id": "claim_96c053cdb46a4bee82188877cdd6cbb6",
      "statement": "Hub creation on the Go server is performed through the atomic CreateHubIfAbsent primitive on zerohub.ZeroHub, so concurrent create requests for the same hub ID collapse to a single hub: the race winner creates and the rest receive ErrHubAlreadyExists (surfaced as HTTP 409) instead of orphaning a hub.",
